# Room features

## Layout (`room-client.tsx`)

- Full-height shell below global navbar (`h-[calc(100dvh-4rem)]`).
- Root element: `data-room-shell` for light-mode CSS variable overrides.
- **Main section**: post-it overlay (`RoomPostItStack`, z-20) + pomodoro center (z-10).
- **Aside**: `RoomTodoPanel` (collapsible) above `RoomChat`.
- **Share**: `room-share-link.tsx` modal — copy link or email invite (`invite-actions.ts` → `signInWithOtp`).
- Background image with gradient overlay; header has participants, appearance, wallpaper, fullscreen, visibility (owner), favorite, share, music player.

## Header icon buttons

- Use `ROOM_HEADER_ICON_BUTTON` from `lib/room-ui.ts` for square header controls (hover: `bg-secondary`).
- `RoomClient` must pass `roomOwnerId` and wire `ParticipantList` with `roomId`, `isRoomOwner`, `socket`.

## Participant menu (`participant-list.tsx`)

- Compact variant: click-to-open panel **portaled to `document.body`** (fixed position, `z-[120]`).
- Search filters other users; current user pinned on top in bordered card with Active/Away/Invisible toggles (`room:presence:set`).
- Others sorted below; invisible users omitted entirely from other viewers' lists/counts; grey dot for self only.
- Actions per other user: friend request (`friends/actions.ts`), kick for owner (`member-actions.ts` + `room:member:kick`).
- Last row tooltips: `side="top"` to avoid overflow clipping.

## Post-its in rooms

- `RoomPostItStack` loads via `fetchPostItsForRoom(roomId)`; lifts task state to `room-client` for todo panel sync.
- `RoomPostItToolbar` bottom bar: color picker + add note.
- `RoomTaskPrompt` modal on first visit when room has no tasks (sessionStorage skip key per room).

## Realtime

- `useRoomSocket` hook: chat, pomodoro, music broadcast, participants, visibility, membership revoked.
- Kicked users: `room:membership-revoked` with `reason: "kicked"` → `/rooms?removed=kicked`.
- Listing presence: `use-room-listing-presence.ts`, socket `/presence` endpoint.

## Room listing (`rooms-directory.tsx`)

- Tabs: trending, private, friends, favorites.
- `RoomFavoriteButton` on cards; avoid `revalidatePath` in favorite toggle action.

## Pointer events (critical)

Pomodoro wrapper is `pointer-events-none`; timer card is `pointer-events-auto`. Post-it stack uses `pointer-events-none` on full-area wrapper with `pointer-events-auto` on notes/toolbar — otherwise post-its cannot be clicked/dragged.

## Navbar on room pages

Global navbar shows via `conditional-navbar.tsx` (hidden only on `/dashboard`).
